OL,3,GNEWSASex offender left victim scarred
OL,4,Aduring 'horrific' campaign of abuse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sex offender who left a woman scarred
OL,7,Fduring a "horrific" campaign of abuse
OL,8,Fand coercive control has been jailed
OL,9,Ffor six years.
OL,11,FThe High Court in Edinburgh heard that
OL,12,FCharlie Swain also beat her with a belt
OL,13,Fand held a knife to her neck before she
OL,14,Fcontacted police.
OL,16,FThe court hear the woman suffered
OL,17,Frepeated violence and intimidation over
OL,18,Fa prolonged period, and that he marked
OL,19,Fher body so that "everyone would know
OL,20,Fthat I was his".
