OL,5,
OL,6,FSwain, now 21, had denied a series of
OL,7,Fcharges during an earlier trial but was
OL,8,Fconvicted of three offences, including
OL,9,Fsubjecting the victim to repeated abuse
OL,10,Fat locations in Edinburgh.
